    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Tucked away on the ever popular Kirwan Street, this charming two bedroomed cottage offers an ideal blend of character, comfort and city convenience. \r\nThe accommodation comprises of a bright living room, a well appointed kitchen, and two comfortable bedrooms, all presented in freshly decorated, walk in condition. The property benefits from electric heating, ensuring efficient and easily managed comfort throughout the year.\r\nPerfectly positioned just minutes from the City Centre, this home enjoys immediate access to a wide range of local amenities, cafes, shops, schools and excellent public transport links, making it an ideal choice for owner occupiers or investors alike. \r\nA rare opportunity to acquire a low maintenance city cottage in a highly convenient and established Dublin 7 location.   \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\twith alarm control panel \r\n   \r\nLounge: with feature marble fireplace with wooden mantle, electric inset fire, laminate wood floor and fitted storage press  \t\t\t\tc.1.9x2.6m  \r\n\r\nKitchen:  with fitted kitchen units, tiled splash-back, laminate wood floor, plumbed for washing machine, oven and hob, Velux roof window \t\t        \t\tc.1.9x2.3m                                                    \t\t                                      \r\n\t\t                        \r\nBedroom 1: with storage closet and access door to rear yard\t\t \t\t\r\nc.3.2x4.6m         \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  with fitted shelving \t \t\t\t\t\r\nc.2.1x2.5m\r\n\r\nBathroom: with Triton electric shower, W.C and W.H.B, fully tiled walls and floor\t\t\r\nc.1.9x1.5m"
